    <string name="about_r4_expanded">About R4 ▲</string>
    <string name="about_r4_text">R4 is a local message archive designed to keep frequently used text immediately available while you stay in another app. Create and manage messages in R4, choose a target app and start the floating overlay. Tap a saved message in the overlay to copy its full text to the clipboard, then paste it where you need it. You can also create a new message directly from the overlay by pasting text from the clipboard and giving it a title. R4 preserves emoji, line breaks, blank lines and spaces, does not alter your text, and does not send anything on your behalf.</string>
